{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1311402001:0":{"text":"なあ……俺たち、探検に行くんだよな？","source_cn":"那个……我记得我们说好要去探险？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51817945A8CFC88F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311402002:0":{"text":"う、うん、でもまだ食料や道具の準備が……","source_cn":"的确……不过我们还没有准备探险时的食物和工具……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE588710349838AA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311402003:1":{"text":"それは祭典が終わってから……って、もう終わったの？","source_cn":"等祭典结束以后再……咦，祭典结束了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D717146BBD4C3D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311402004:1":{"text":"まだ始まったばかりじゃ……？","source_cn":"……不应该是刚开始没多久吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA857E4CBFB8A02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311402005:0":{"text":"皆さんが無事で良かったです！","source_cn":"你们也没事了，太好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F3E429C348FAF7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311402006:1":{"text":"え？何を言って